{"timestamp":1775016485731,"source_app":"agentic-harness","session_id":"5fa36ad2-ff98-499b-a658-60cc726c4e39","hook_event_type":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_use_id":"toolu_0141Cu1sontZ1EiCgrNcdXmf","payload":{"session_id":"5fa36ad2-ff98-499b-a658-60cc726c4e39","transcript_path":"/Users/rivero/.claude/projects/-Users-rivero-ai-agentic-harness-apps-mas-trees-pw-4bd2cd17/5fa36ad2-ff98-499b-a658-60cc726c4e39.jsonl","cwd":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-harness/apps/mas/trees/pw-4bd2cd17","permission_mode":"bypassPermissions","hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-harness/apps/mas/trees/pw-4bd2cd17/.pinata/specs/issue-8-adw-af431276-sdlc_planner-add-pinata-gitignore.md","content":"# Plan: Add .pinata/ runtime directories to .gitignore\n\n## Summary\nAdd specific .pinata/ directory entries to .gitignore to prevent accidental commits of workflow runtime artifacts while preserving committed directories like specs/ and docs/.\n\n## Task Description\nAdd .pinata/ runtime directories to .gitignore to prevent accidental commits of workflow artifacts. The pinata workflows engine creates a .pinata/ directory in worktrees for runtime artifacts. The committed subdirs (specs/, docs/) should remain tracked, but runtime directories should be ignored.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `.gitignore` - Main gitignore file that needs to be updated with new .pinata/ entries\n\n## Step by Step Tasks\n\n### 1. Update .gitignore with .pinata/ entries\n- Add `.pinata/logs/` entry to ignore workflow logs\n- Add `.pinata/reports/` entry to ignore workflow reports  \n- Add `.pinata/agents/` entry to ignore workflow agent artifacts\n- Add `.pinata/ports.env` entry to ignore runtime port configuration\n- Add `.pinata/stack.json` entry to ignore runtime stack configuration\n\n### 2. Verify .gitignore syntax\n- Ensure the new entries follow proper gitignore syntax\n- Confirm entries are placed in logical location within file\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- .pinata/logs/ directory is ignored by git\n- .pinata/reports/ directory is ignored by git\n- .pinata/agents/ directory is ignored by git\n- .pinata/ports.env file is ignored by git\n- .pinata/stack.json file is ignored by git\n- .pinata/specs/ and .pinata/docs/ directories remain tracked by git\n- No existing .gitignore functionality is broken\n\n## Validation Commands\n- `git status` to verify runtime artifacts are no longer tracked\n- `git check-ignore .pinata/logs/` should return the path (meaning it's ignored)\n- `git check-ignore .pinata/specs/` should return nothing (meaning it's tracked)"},"tool_use_id":"toolu_0141Cu1sontZ1EiCgrNcdXmf"}}
